  <content>
    <section class="numbered-exercises" id="sect-00001">      <title>Activity</title>
      <para id="para-00001">Write the following terms and definitions in your math notebook:</para>
      <para id="para-00002">A <term class="glossary-tooltip" id="term-00001">geometric sequence</term>
        is a sequence in which each term is found by multiplying the previous term by the same
        constant. </para>
      <para id="para-00003">The number that is multiplied by each term is called the <term class="glossary-tooltip" id="term-00002">common ratio</term>.</para>
      <!--Text
      Entry Interaction Start -->
